menu "MMRoIP"

    config MMROIP_MDNS
        bool "Advertise over mDNS"
        default y
        help
            Makes <device_name>.local resolve and advertises the _mmroip._tcp service. A convenience
            only: MMROIP-CORE-SPEC.md §6.2 requires every protocol test to pass with it compiled out.
            About 35 KB.

    config MMROIP_ETHERNET
        bool "Ethernet first (ESP32 Ethernet MAC with an RMII PHY)"
        depends on SOC_EMAC_SUPPORTED
        default n
        help
            A cable with a link and a DHCP address wins; Wi-Fi is off while it lasts and comes back when the
            cable goes. The PHY pins come from mmroip_config_t in mmroip_start(). A board application
            usually selects this.

endmenu
